Darkvoid was demonstrated to [[the Professor]] by [[Rassimov]] by destroying [[Eathon the dog]]'s toy ball. He again used the spell in a fit of rage to destroy [[Cavalier]] because the Titan wouldn't bond to him. {{Template:Source|Memory Lane}} He attempted to use the spell to destroy [[Behemoth]] but was stopped by a [[Boltflare]] from [[Lok]]. {{source|Ladies' Choice}} In [[King Solomon's Mines]], Rassimov intended to use the power to destroy [[Tao]] but was stopped by [[the Professor]]. {{source|To Be Together}} 

Upon returning as a member of the [[Blood Spiral]], Rassimov used the spell to destroy [[Archwarder]] in [[Klaus' bookshop]]. {{Template:Source|The Blood Spiral}} At the [[Tomb of Tutankhamun]], Rassimov attempted to use Darkvoid to destroy Dante's team. However, Dante invoked the [[Titan]], [[Maelstrom]], and the attack was instead absorbed and Rassimov neutralized. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}

